1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Aki Barnas was about 18th generation from the Pajaran Kingdom  (Dalam 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cikundul) of West Java, of which Prabu (King) Siliwangi is most the most famous.  HIs wife was also a member of this royal family (but not closely related).  Aki Barnas as one of 22 children.  During the Dutch period he became Res
2 CONC ident (Mayor) of Bogor.
